    {
      "id": "13804",
      "body": "hi User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d \n\nFirst to answer you question regarding the behaviour on the ‘see full recently viewed’ page - I believe the behaviour should be consistent with the product card on PLP. User:60d1a439f65054006947ea0d or User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950 correct me if your expectation is different.\n\nNext on the AC’s:\n\n**PLP variation**\n\n- Whats been listed seems correct but can you confirm if the interactions when the client clicks on the bag, or selects a size (mobile and desktop) are captured on another ticket?\n      - If yes this section is approved if no then they need to be added\n\n**Home page variation**\n\n- User:712020:4ec4770e-9470-4885-9753-69a36b6cf950 I assume it is correct that the bag should be excluded from homepage, so if a client wants to add to bag they must click on the product tile (image, name) so that they land on the PDP for that product\n\n**Wishlist variation**\n\nApproved\n\n**Recently Viewed Full History variation (same behavior as PLP card)**\n\n- open questions above to be confirmed.\n\n**Variation extensibility**\n\nAgreed",
